    "title": "Cortez Residents Invited to Meet Finalists for Public Library Director Position - NewsBreak",
    "text": "32 minutes ago The City of Cortez will hold a Meet & Greet event for the four finalists for the Cortez Public Library Director position. The event is scheduled for Wednesday, December 10, from 5:00 PM to 6:30 PM at Cortez City Hall, 123 Roger Smith Avenue.\nColumbia Ltd., the recruiting firm, reviewed over 30 applications and selected four finalists. Residents are invited to attend, meet the candidates, ask questions, and provide feedback. The city is seeking community input in the selection process.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.",
